    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the problem is there is no variable left to control. when you look at the data, the trend is just... downward. it feels like the system is finally correcting itself. like i was just a bump in the curve that's being smoothed out. it's hard to see \"agency\" in something that feels so fundamentally broken and inevitable. it's like trying to argue with gravity.",
